      "sourceTextSha256": "b000f06958538ffaecf13ad44acfa0c2bac792de9a3b008e60632323f86ea614",
      "text": "Today, the ship reaches the Chonos Archipelago. Heading towards the Moraleda Channel, the vessel cruises around the area of San Rafael National Park, a biosphere reserve, if weather permits. The park is the main entry point to Chile's Northern Patagonian Ice Field. We will also explore the surrounding fjords, channels, islands, and coves. ",
