      "sourceTextSha256": "bc29e43cba6b2c20659a838a3bb95ba1f570f73cdf6b8e597a5359f41a2dbefd",
      "text": "As we sail south, we cross the Gulf of Penas, enjoying beautiful views of the surrounding mountain ranges. The expedition team tells us about the indigenous inhabitants of these southern lands, the early Spanish colonizers, and famous explorers such as Charles Darwin, Fitz Roy, and Alberto de Agostini. We also learn about the region's biodiversity through presentations about the local marine fauna and flora. ",
